SUMMARY: I Heart Market Street -- Music on Market St.
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some evening pop with Cameron Tania.\n\nCameron Tania\,
  known as Toronto’s Plus Size Pop Princess\; is a multi-talented Queer & 
 Neurodivergent artist and vocal coach. With a substantial TikTok followin
 g exceeding 60k\, she was honoured as Oshawa’s Songwriter of the Year in 
 2022 and received nominations for “Emerging Artist of the Year” and “Durh
 am Song of the Year.” Holding three diplomas in Arts\, Vocal Music and So
 ngwriting & Performance\, Cameron is a seasoned artist and coach with ove
 r a decade of experience. She is currently developing her new pop Album t
 itled “I Know You’re Watching”.\n\n"I Heart Market Street" is a series of
  free musical concerts presented on Tuesdays and Wednesdays throughout th
 e summer.\n\nTuesdays & Wednesdays\, 11:30am-1:30pm and 5pm-7pm.\nBegins:
  June 2\, 2026\nEnds: September 29\, 2026.\n\nPresented by the Old Town T
 oronto BIA.\n\nFree
