SUMMARY: I Heart Market Street -- Music on Market St.
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some cool Latin rhythms at lunchtime with Luis Anselmi.
 \n\nLuis Anselmi\, mentor of the Latin GRAMMY Cultural Foundation\, skill
 fully merges his Venezuelan roots with diverse music influences. Proficie
 nt in playing the Venezuelan Cuatro\, piano\, and singing\, he creates a 
 vibrant Latin-World sound. With uplifting rhythms and lyrics\, his music 
 is a captivating celebration that will inspire you to dance!\n\n"I Heart 
 Market Street" is a series of free musical concerts presented on Tuesdays
  and Wednesdays throughout the summer.\n\nTuesdays & Wednesdays\, 11:30am
 -1:30pm and 5pm-7pm.\nBegins: June 2\, 2026\nEnds: September 29\, 2026.\n
 \nPresented by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree
