SUMMARY: A Thing of Beauty -- The Early Years of Toronto's Old City Hall
DESCRIPTION:Friends of Old City Hall presents a free screening of the ins
 piring film documenting the early years of Toronto's Old City Hall.\n\nA 
 Thing of Beauty: The Early Years of Toronto's Old City Hall (78 minutes)\
 n\nDirected by Michael Kainer\n\nThe film describes and beautifully illus
 trates the building at the geographic centre and heart of civic life in T
 oronto for the first half of the 20th century. It makes a compelling case
  for preserving this precious piece of our history.\n\nRegistration requi
 red: https://www.friendsofoldcityhall.ca/athingofbeauty https://www.frien
 dsofoldcityhall.ca/athingofbeauty\n\nFree.
