 in along with other influential women who shaped Black music throughout t
 he 1960s\, 1970s\, and 1980s.\n\nTheir dynamic live show delivers the tim
 eless soul\, energy\, and sophistication of this unforgettable era\, a cr
 owd-pleasing sound and an experience audiences will never forget.\n\nMusi
