 2:00 PM and 1:00 PM.\n\nOpera Atelier has once again partnered with the O
 ld Town Toronto BIA to produce Opera Sundays on Market Street https://can
 va.link/3zg5xifcvjhz05d ! Join them one Sunday each summer month for beau
 tiful sung performances by Artists of Opera Atelier.\n\nFree\n\n
